      "writtenOn": "2026-04-21T18:13:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So to summarize what I just wrote, maybe let\u0027s proceed as follows:\n\n1. Keep this fallback sequence as is, with 50ms delays, not 50us (even if your intention was 50us)\n2. But move pkvm_udelay() to panic.c as an internal helper instead of an API function (and somehow rename it accordingly), so that this `!tsc_khz` fallback makes sense?\n\nWDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "93887192_20883e9c",
      "revId": "8a9b85cbced8a0fad005b835c8a409a6b7fb1b96",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
