      "message": "\u003e But move pkvm_udelay() to panic.c as an internal helper instead of an API function (and somehow rename it accordingly), so that this !tsc_khz fallback makes sense?\n\nAlthough I\u0027m still hesitating whether it wouldn\u0027t be better to just require non-zero tsc_khz during pKVM initialization (so that in pKVM we can just rely on it, in this and other cases, without such hacky fallbacks)...",
